Error [E2913]: a reactive signal can't hold a fn() -> Int
  --> tests/ui/reactive_signal_of_function.jet:8:26
    |
  8 |     s := reactive.signal(helper)
    |                          ^^^^^^
 Why: signals and derived values hold ordinary data so they can be copied to dependents
 Fix: use a data value (number, text, list, struct, …); wrap behaviour in `reactive.effect` instead

Error [E0311]: `get` isn't a method on this value
  --> tests/ui/reactive_signal_of_function.jet:9:13
    |
  9 |     print(s.get())
    |             ^^^
 Why: only struct and enum values have instance methods
 Fix: check the spelling of `get`
